{"data":{"body":"[P2] An ordinary exception from `MDC.getCopyOfContextMap()` is routed through initialization failure handling and permanently marks the durable execution `FAILED`, even though this is a transient logging-adapter failure before user code starts. Capture MDC best-effort with an empty fallback, or classify this as a retryable invocation failure; update the test so an MDC snapshot failure cannot create a terminal business failure.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc774ngd","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":446,"observation_digest":"ff60159ce5bbfe7f54013ec84bf8cd04a4ee47437292a0c225dd3f5fb2bc61d1","observation_id":"aro_v1_75qblhhfxp7h6vabh3eex6gnas","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:59:55Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5zfolgp3vq7gwoomppogn5kpej","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"f6d734424f8df2dadb2d75fac3942b1a8d883952","reviewer":"codex","start_line":446,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_qviyvgucqdam7sg2qyqqbbyvjr","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:59:55Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
